#. translators: link to Giggle API docs
#: includes/Settings.php:81
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Enter your Giggle credentials. You can find your API key and hotel code in "
"the <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Giggle CMS</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"Gib deine Giggle-Zugangsdaten ein. Deinen API-Schlüssel und Hotelcode "
"findest du im <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">"
"Giggle CMS</a>."

#: includes/Settings.php:100
msgid ""
"Your Giggle API key. This key is sent as the api-key request header and is "
"never exposed in the frontend HTML."
msgstr ""
"Dein Giggle-API-Schlüssel. Dieser Schlüssel wird als API-Schlüssel-"
"Anfragekopf gesendet und wird im Frontend-HTML nie angezeigt."

#: includes/Settings.php:118
msgid ""
"The unique code from your Giggle WebApp URL — for example, \"giggletips\" "
"from giggle.tips/giggletips."
msgstr ""
"Der einzigartige Code aus deiner Giggle WebApp-URL – zum Beispiel "
"\"giggletips\" von giggle.tips/giggletips."

#: includes/Settings.php:145
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen speichern"

